            <div xml:id="m-d7b9a207-91e7-4892-9581-38b20c8eccad">
              <lg xml:id="m-96ddd9a7-66b3-4878-8b11-33e6a368c55f">
                <l xml:id="m-dda8e4d2-f4da-4554-a8a9-ebec3088b4e2" facs="#m-70dd39db-3299-462b-aa9e-293155745988" label="text-like">13th Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-9468ce49-966c-46c3-84cf-e9dbd73fa738" facs="#m-399eadb7-87d4-4a79-9c9b-dd183ef09bc5" label="ambiguous">1035</l><l xml:id="m-0f4841cb-2f6c-4ccc-8e79-915162321a2b" facs="#m-051aa3b4-a7dc-47ec-a619-d89f41f4e53f" label="lyrics-like">a gene-ra-ti-ó¬</l><l xml:id="m-e49a6905-234a-4a32-8f3d-2a5e6036660c" facs="#m-e2c0fb7f-a34e-4f63-b1a0-54562b328e7d" label="ambiguous">ne</l><l xml:id="m-9b4a8ef1-f90a-4b43-a7a2-4ea54910d191" facs="#m-8426caac-5621-4232-b3ac-4bf6a9988523" label="lyrics-like">et progé- ni- e.</l><l xml:id="m-db8613e0-39f8-494b-93f6-18f13dafc452" facs="#m-945822dd-a88c-4129-8ee4-a84ac8dec182" label="ambiguous">Sequentia sancti Evangelli secundum Lucam. Luc. 17.c.</l><l xml:id="m-9a841b23-644d-4e3a-9447-b58d1b8a068f" facs="#m-1586556c-8345-423e-846c-f61ea290141d" label="lyrics-like">N illo témpore: Dum iret Jesus lut vidit quia mundátus est, regrés¬</l><l xml:id="m-2a25e7bd-c277-405f-8033-4783037fe7a6" facs="#m-d167b842-64be-4cc0-a966-dabf2ea7ba11" label="lyrics-like">L in Jerúsalem, transibat per mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-5c66e973-937b-40ad-ad08-db3761416639" facs="#m-fbabcc98-80c9-42c1-92a8-9bdf94295922" label="lyrics-like">sus est, cum magna voce magnífi¬</l><l xml:id="m-38db632e-4316-4478-ba40-811edd1fd8df" facs="#m-c503ab8e-d35e-48c8-bc4c-2db9593ca812" label="lyrics-like">diam Samaríam et Galilaéam. Et</l><l xml:id="m-e0c34b11-9ba1-4a2e-b2a4-cb94d7e78da9" facs="#m-fdf9ea31-65b3-474f-8142-d2f74273b638" label="lyrics-like">cans Deum, et cécidit in fáciem</l><l xml:id="m-71790ff1-9f7f-4f9d-bfbe-11a6d5204d73" facs="#m-8d4debd5-cf84-4fb6-97bd-833dc7380b8f" label="lyrics-like">cum ingrederétur quoddam castél¬</l><l xml:id="m-4f98eb26-74b5-4c31-8fa2-d609d4aaa6dc" facs="#m-43322c83-be87-4a12-b677-74a1260fc32e" label="lyrics-like">ante pedes ejus, grátias agens: et</l><l xml:id="m-a505056b-b412-4dc3-8614-a58b03e01f12" facs="#m-a2f9d256-3c79-42da-a262-b9bba6c9f659" label="lyrics-like">lum, occurrérunt ei decem viri le¬</l><l xml:id="m-5073f7c9-4ec6-4537-8be6-1877a5cd250d" facs="#m-b3d981cf-9f81-40d5-ad57-1f12b0bbb3a1" label="lyrics-like">hic erat Samaritánus. Respóndens</l><l xml:id="m-a36da8dc-582e-4722-ba64-1c53a43c4f26" facs="#m-de5cb133-6a72-4d8c-a399-31582af27b77" label="ambiguous">autem Jesus, dixit: Nonne decem</l><l xml:id="m-c93aa6fa-8a09-4611-9a41-6342769a4e1c" facs="#m-4055da27-f5cd-4e4d-9c8f-9981737015e0" label="lyrics-like">prósi, qui stetérunt a longe; et leva¬</l><l xml:id="m-9c4d1223-b29e-4531-8cd8-141db24b37af" facs="#m-85e66ccd-6df4-42ab-95b9-9d47309cb790" label="lyrics-like">mundáti sunt? et novem ubi sunt?</l><l xml:id="m-9a353ae9-fb67-49fd-b1ac-8a87cae3f4b1" facs="#m-d3c34148-b3d7-4344-98ce-99d04ca9401e" label="lyrics-like">vérunt vocem, dicéntes: Jesu prae¬</l><l xml:id="m-de0c96dd-5513-4b5b-a943-dd23de8c7b36" facs="#m-defbbe98-a818-4a72-b7e4-47623e5e940e" label="lyrics-like">céptor, miserére nostri. Quos ut</l><l xml:id="m-c5a10b49-4fc9-4472-baf0-ba909d1a64a6" facs="#m-1d137651-6824-446a-a147-f5f92f338936" label="lyrics-like">Non est invéntus qui rediret, et</l><l xml:id="m-e1b0767f-0091-4e9e-8fc3-41b2dd7aa60b" facs="#m-a75eae4d-9e3f-438d-8fc7-b3895cb3bc32" label="lyrics-like">daret glóriam Deo, nisi hic alieni¬</l><l xml:id="m-b8d3aed2-e8e4-4104-bd57-0402b5069f53" facs="#m-414c1d08-b78c-426e-bd54-b7f78db30238" label="lyrics-like">vidit, dixit : Ite, osténdite vos sa¬</l><l xml:id="m-dd44c974-f1fe-40ad-a0ea-dc589fd17be4" facs="#m-bbbff31d-9d6c-4500-94e2-d5f483c89dd0" label="lyrics-like">cerdótibus. Et factum est, dum irent,</l><l xml:id="m-12ab6c78-b642-4c7c-8f1d-43432f5df932" facs="#m-2ff9d804-beeb-4d85-94e4-42462b9f9643" label="lyrics-like">gena. Ét ait illi : Surge, vade; quia</l><l xml:id="m-e3365945-210b-4d86-ac51-104e76a1e75a" facs="#m-b39c9d6c-819e-4a67-ac5f-2e33a9ebf4ec" label="lyrics-like">mundáti sunt. Unus autem ex illis,  fides tua te salvum fecit. Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-5e8bc020-3444-4811-bf1d-4a0ddf462bc4" facs="#m-18ae207c-db38-43fa-8f66-a05848a99e49" label="ambiguous">offert.</l><l xml:id="m-bb31577c-4d4f-4681-bb2b-09bdecfb4928" facs="#m-b09e9a54-647d-4a6b-811d-0403a945efc9" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-280f62f7-0ab2-415d-a3cd-e69eacc1b87b" facs="#m-4259cdda-a8ec-4b35-984b-dcde75385f69" label="ambiguous">1</l><l xml:id="m-b9f937b6-9f0c-4b69-bb0e-f13b2a0df600" facs="#m-4a43bbbd-07c1-4b36-8826-893475d9ef43" label="lyrics-like">Dómi- ne: díxi:</l><l xml:id="m-188f05e2-6aaa-4542-9e97-0fe54af3d5ea" facs="#m-cf0733df-5baf-4f49-8a1d-aed56aefc7fb" label="lyrics-like">N te spe-rá¬ vi,</l><l xml:id="m-74038c99-eeee-4b8c-9885-35488ed88eef" facs="#m-91fbb18f-4c0e-43f2-bed0-41bd6b994b5a" label="lyrics-like">in má¬ nibus tú¬ is</l><l xml:id="m-ad8720e9-fab8-4eec-8a78-2420280b77ca" facs="#m-e359b376-4876-47db-8219-2948b4f8c473" label="lyrics-like">Tu es Dé¬ us mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-58e905a3-f7a9-4a4a-867d-f53e97e82b2b" facs="#m-89722c3b-e20e-4f7a-940b-471918d3d58c" label="ambiguous">us.</l><l xml:id="m-ca3c75b6-378d-48c6-860f-6db9cccc56f8" facs="#m-7a33b8cb-b7a2-4a27-9f03-6415cff4c7ff" label="lyrics-like">tém¬</l><l xml:id="m-223462ed-0732-4c52-8397-5bd9033678e7" facs="#m-5d62e034-d1ef-484a-b6eb-ed545fc125de" label="lyrics-like">po-ra mé¬ a.</l><l xml:id="m-d832864f-cfe3-4a4f-bf09-5d5d610fed5a" facs="#m-caa8fcf2-db9c-4909-acc8-5fa43eceb713" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-94bc3d92-2be4-4900-b6d0-d788eed55fc2" facs="#m-84625835-9f1c-440e-9e4a-3c2f2dee2cff" label="lyrics-like">DRopitiáre, Dómine, pópulo tuo, nobis tribuas, et postuláta concé¬</l><l xml:id="m-6fb15cb5-ac4b-41fe-9c50-5903c21c0f48" facs="#m-7cb8d102-bdef-4b87-9ee0-d32b44f33603" label="lyrics-like">propitiare munéribus: ut hac das. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-d40c1494-e358-4a9d-9311-fa52f6881a07" facs="#m-e7058927-817c-4dfa-99bb-807a41fa2c11" label="lyrics-like">oblatióne placátus, et indulgéntiam</l><l xml:id="m-c50f8ecc-2960-4336-8931-08d4e5f48322" facs="#m-53e3a1fd-d871-43b1-821b-204f1ef69381" label="lyrics-like">2. Exáudi nos. p. 501. — 3. At the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-b7f9b78a-f9dd-4f69-a46a-0b0ed7c9cf09" facs="#m-5e18833b-acf2-433c-976f-aabc1b17b869" label="ambiguous">comm.</l><l xml:id="m-0544ef25-e4c7-4ef4-8316-770df89eb70a" facs="#m-a27109ea-cd6c-4c0a-997c-0d38e77f5626" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-a5b23fd7-f1fa-4372-80cc-88969ea66560" facs="#m-cddd23cb-dafd-4ff3-85c4-890716e4c70c" label="lyrics-like">dedísti</l><l xml:id="m-a54a8364-0180-48c0-b1eb-dc574ab9810a" facs="#m-18bf5609-a7ee-4a9b-9f15-dd751450dd73" label="lyrics-like">nó-bis, Dó-mi¬</l><l xml:id="m-5e5f81b1-c916-475d-aa9d-92fc7c9853bc" facs="#m-023decfa-9e47-42c6-832c-f0ee2c96319d" label="lyrics-like">A-nem de caé¬ lo</l><l xml:id="m-6aae7b48-8590-496e-838f-7027f76e0bcd" facs="#m-8f499654-6369-41c1-9762-f6a8a7125f6d" label="ambiguous">L</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
